      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Francisville%2C_Louisiana",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Spanish rule in the Florida Parishes brought the Nueva Feliciana district to St. Francisville by 1785, encouraging Anglo-American planters to cultivate fertile soils.",
